    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\left(x-\\frac52\\right)^2-\\frac14$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2-5x+6&=\\left(x-\\frac52\\right)^2-\\frac{25}{4}+6\\\\x^2-5x+6&=\\left(x-\\frac52\\right)^2-\\frac14.\\end{align*}$$",
